Named module of Business Evidence Wallet. This note is host-tree honesty only.

## Current host facts

- There is no `src/domain/retention.ts` and no `scripts/purge-expired.mjs` on master.
- FACTORY_BACKLOG still marks a scheduled retention purge and migration 0043 as NEEDS-ANDY. That work is not shipped here.
- Housing Compliance Vault therefore has no automated retention purge runtime on this tree.
- Draft PR #134 stays frozen. This note does not add a purge scheduler, migration, or deletion job.

## Claims this file does not make

- No automated retention-purge claim.
- No erasure-complete claim.
- No legal-hold engine claim.
